    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "also exercise ... in accordance with the provisions in any Civil Procedure Convention"; what the Convention provides is outside the sources

`o 25 r 3(3) one month` MEANS Period WITH
    `period length` IS 1
    `period unit` IS Months
