-- Paragraph (3)(a): "after the date of settlement, discontinuance or withdrawal (as the case may be) or the last hearing date, whichever is later".
-- src:3964 | (3) A request for refund of court fees must be made in writing — ( a )
-- src:3965 | where the application is for a refund of hearing fees — within one month after the date of settlement, discontinuance or withdrawal (as the case may be) or the last hearing date, whichever is later;
-- src:3966 | ( b )
