-- src:3970 | ( d )
-- src:3971 | in any other case — within one month after the date on which the reason for the refund arose.
@ref O 25 r 3(3) (src:3964-3971)
GIVEN `the date of settlement, discontinuance or withdrawal, if any` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the last hearing date` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`o 25 r 3(3)(a) the date the month runs from` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the date of settlement, discontinuance or withdrawal, if any`
    WHEN JUST settled THEN
        IF settled GREATER THAN `the last hearing date`
        THEN settled
        ELSE `the last hearing date`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the last hearing date`

